  <!-- EN: Painful regeneration -->
  <OWD_PainfulRegenerationThought.stages.Painful_regeneration.label>苦痛再生</OWD_PainfulRegenerationThought.stages.Painful_regeneration.label>
  <!-- EN: I can feel all the cells of my body being constantly prodded, moved, and shifted around in a painful way. Every wound slowly heals in an excruciating manner. -->
  <OWD_PainfulRegenerationThought.stages.Painful_regeneration.description>我能感觉到身体里的所有细胞都在以一种痛苦的方式被不断地拨动、移动和转移。每一个伤口都在以一种令人难以忍受的方式缓慢愈合。</OWD_PainfulRegenerationThought.stages.Painful_regeneration.description>
  
